  "player_hint_1_en": "Only one square fits Erin's clue (\"She was beside a shelf and a table.\"). So Erin (E) must be at row 8, column 5. Cross out her row and column.",
  "player_hint_2_en": "Alma can't be at row 7, column 2; row 7, column 4: in each case Gilbert would have nowhere left to go. Suppose Alma were at row 7, column 1: then Basil's clue (\"He was exactly one row north of Vince.\") could not be true. So Alma can't be there. Testing the remaining squares the same way rules out a few more. So Alma (A) must be at row 7, column 3. Cross out her row and column.",
  "player_hint_3_en": "With the rows and columns of Erin and Alma crossed out, only one square is left for Celeste that fits her clue (\"She was in the Restroom, but not beside a trashcan.\"). So Celeste (C) must be at row 2, column 1. Cross out her row and column.",
  "player_hint_4_en": "Fiona and Horace can only use columns 6 and 7, so nobody else can be in those columns. So Dexter (D) must be at row 9, column 4. Cross out his row and column.",
  "player_hint_5_en": "Basil's own clue (\"He was exactly one row north of Vince.\") rules out more squares. Basil is now the only person who can still go in row 3. So Basil (B) must be at row 3, column 9. Cross out his row and column.",
  "player_hint_6_en": "Fiona is now the only person who can still go in row 5. So Fiona (F) must be at row 5, column 6. Cross out her row and column.",
  "player_hint_7_en": "With the rows and columns of everyone placed so far crossed out, only one square is left for Horace that fits his clue (\"He was the only man in the Back Alley.\"). So Horace (H) must be at row 1, column 7. Cross out his row and column.",
  "player_hint_8_en": "Using Basil's clue (\"He was exactly one row north of Vince.\"), some squares are ruled out for Vince. So Vince (the victim) must be at row 4, column 8. Cross out his row and column.",
  "player_hint_9_en": "With the rows and columns of everyone placed so far crossed out, only one square is left for Gilbert that fits his clue (\"He was in the Jukebox Corner, but not beside a speaker.\"). So Gilbert (G) must be at row 6, column 2. Cross out his row and column. Basil is the only person in the Store Room with Vince, so Basil is the murderer!"
 },
